---
// src/pages/industries/enterprise.astro
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Infrastructure Sourcing for Enterprise Organizations | InfraHub"
  description="Enterprise infrastructure advisory: VMware licensing alternatives (Vates / KVM), sovereign cloud data residency, and enterprise hardware sourcing."
  canonicalPath="/industries/enterprise"
>
  <div class="section section-hero network-overlay">
    <div class="container industry-container">
      <div class="industry-header">
        <span class="industry-kicker">INDUSTRY SOURCING FRAMEWORK</span>
        <h1>Enterprise Infrastructure Teams</h1>
        <p class="lead">
          Address virtualization licensing changes, evaluate data-location and governance requirements, and source enterprise hardware with supplier-specific warranty and support terms.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="industry-stack-grid">
        <div class="stack-card">
          <span class="stack-pill">Virtualization Strategy</span>
          <h2>VMware Alternatives (Vates / Proxmox)</h2>
          <p>Evaluate production-ready hypervisors with warm migration tooling, enterprise SAN multipathing, and backup integrity to replace Broadcom per-core subscriptions.</p>
          <a href="/partners/vates" class="stack-link">Explore Vates Architecture →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="stack-card">
          <span class="stack-pill">Compliance</span>
          <h2>Sovereign Cloud & Data Residency</h2>
          <p>Source compliant private cloud and colocation facilities located strictly within European legal jurisdictions, meeting GDPR and NIS2 compliance criteria.</p>
          <a href="/solutions/cloud-virtualization" class="stack-link">Review Sovereign Cloud Options →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="stack-card">
          <span class="stack-pill">Hardware Procurement</span>
          <h2>Enterprise Hardware Sourcing</h2>
          <p>Procure enterprise dual-socket server configurations and network switches with pre-tested burn-in validation and 3-year advanced hardware replacement.</p>
          <a href="/offers" class="stack-link">Inspect Hardware Catalog →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="stack-card">
          <span class="stack-pill">Network Hardening</span>
          <h2>Cybersecurity & Perimeter Defense</h2>
          <p>Engage specialized security teams for independent external penetration testing, perimeter hardening, and BGP route leak monitoring.</p>
          <a href="/solutions/security" class="stack-link">Explore Security Solutions →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="industry-cta-box">
        <h2>Schedule an Enterprise Architecture Review</h2>
        <a href="/lets-talk?industry=enterprise" class="btn btn-accent btn-lg">Consult with Enterprise Architect</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .industry-container { max-width: 1040px; }
  .industry-header { text-align: left; max-width: 860px; margin: 0 0 54px; padding-bottom: 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); }
  .industry-kicker { font-size: 0.74rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--accent-blue); display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .industry-header h1 { font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4vw, 3.4rem); font-weight: 700; margin: 16px 0; }
  .industry-header .lead { font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; }
  .industry-stack-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 60px; }
  @media (min-width: 640px) { .industry-stack-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
  .stack-card { background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 32px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; }
  .stack-pill { font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-teal); letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .stack-card h2 { font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .stack-card p { font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .stack-link { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent-blue); }
  .stack-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .industry-cta-box { background-color: var(--bg-secondary); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 44px 36px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; text-align: left; gap: 16px; }
</style>
